<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended March 29, roastings totaled approximately 270,000 60-kg bags, up from 260,000 bags the previous week and compared with 265,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 4,475,000 60-kg bags, versus 4,335,000 bags in the same year ago period.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk +1 212 859 1640))</p>
